You work hard. You deliver results. Yet somehow, it’s your peers who seem to get all the recognition and advance, while you’re stuck wondering why you’re getting left behind.

In Unforgettable Presence, Lorraine K. Lee reveals the secret that separates those who advance from those who stagnate: knowing how to be seen and heard in the right ways, at the right times, by the right people. Through her proven frameworks and strategies, she shows ambitious professionals how to transform from overlooked to unforgettable.

This book is the ultimate roadmap for how to take control of your career trajectory and create a presence that transforms you from overlooked to truly unforgettable.
